  "hasDescription": [
    {
      "@id": "https://data.datatourisme.fr/13ae8e7c-192e-30d7-9947-f9965a4fda11",
      "dc:description": {
        "de": [
          "Organisation und Betreuung von Quad- und Motorrad-Trail-Touren ab Arras von 3 Stunden bis 3 Tagen, alles inklusive, mit Bereitstellung von Quads oder Oldtimer-Motorrädern.\nEntdecken Sie das Kulturerbe und das Terroir unserer schönen Region Hauts-de-France.\n \nKontakt:\n \nwebsite: www.johgazteam.fr\nmailbox: sasjohgazteam@gmail.com\ntelefon: 0614206563\n\nfacebook: https://www.facebook.com/JOH.GAZ.TEAM.EXPERIENCE/\ninstagram: https://www.instagram.com/johgazteam/?hl=fr\n \n\n\n "
        ],
        "en": [
          "Organization and supervision of quads and motorcycle trails departing from Arras, from 3 hours to 3 days all-inclusive, with quads or vintage motorcycles at your disposal.\nDiscover the heritage and terroir of our beautiful Hauts-de-France region.\n \nContact us for further information:\n \nwebsite : www.johgazteam.fr\nmailbox: sasjohgazteam@gmail.com\ntelephone: 0614206563\n\nfacebook : https://www.facebook.com/JOH.GAZ.TEAM.EXPERIENCE/\ninstagram : https://www.instagram.com/johgazteam/?hl=fr\n \n\n\n "
        ],
        "it": [
          "Organizzazione e supervisione di escursioni in quad e moto con partenza da Arras, da 3 ore a 3 giorni, tutto compreso, con quad o moto d'epoca a disposizione.\nScoprite il patrimonio e i prodotti locali della nostra bella regione Hauts-de-France.\n \nContattateci per maggiori informazioni:\n \nsito web: www.johgazteam.fr\ncasella di posta elettronica: sasjohgazteam@gmail.com\ntelefono: 0614206563\n\nfacebook : https://www.facebook.com/JOH.GAZ.TEAM.EXPERIENCE/\ninstagram : https://www.instagram.com/johgazteam/?hl=fr\n \n\n\n "
        ],
        "fr": [
          "Organisation et encadrement de randonnées quads et motos Trails au départ d'Arras de 3H00 à 3 jours tout inclus avec mise à disposition de quads ou motos vintage.\nA la découverte du patrimoine et du terroir de notre belle région des Hauts-de-France. \n \nContact:\n \nsite internet : www.johgazteam.fr\nboite mail : sasjohgazteam@gmail.com\ntéléphone : 0614206563\n\nfacebook : https://www.facebook.com/JOH.GAZ.TEAM.EXPERIENCE/\ninstagram : https://www.instagram.com/johgazteam/?hl=fr\n \n\n\n "
        ],
        "es": [
          "Organización y supervisión de rutas en quad y moto con salida desde Arras, de 3 horas a 3 días, todo incluido, con quads o motos de época a su disposición.\nDescubra el patrimonio y los productos locales de nuestra hermosa región de Hauts-de-France.\n \nPara más información, póngase en contacto con nosotros:\n \npágina web: www.johgazteam.fr\nbuzón: sasjohgazteam@gmail.com\nteléfono: 0614206563\n\nfacebook : https://www.facebook.com/JOH.GAZ.TEAM.EXPERIENCE/\ninstagram : https://www.instagram.com/johgazteam/?hl=fr\n \n\n\n "
        ],
        "nl": [
          "Organisatie en begeleiding van quad- en motortochten met vertrek vanuit Arras, van 3 uur tot 3 dagen, alles inclusief, met quads of motoren met oldtimers tot je beschikking.\nOntdek het erfgoed en de streekproducten van onze prachtige regio Hauts-de-France.\n \nNeem contact met ons op voor meer informatie:\n \nwebsite: www.johgazteam.fr\nmailbox: sasjohgazteam@gmail.com\ntelefoon: 0614206563\n\nfacebook : https://www.facebook.com/JOH.GAZ.TEAM.EXPERIENCE/\ninstagram : https://www.instagram.com/johgazteam/?hl=fr\n \n\n\n "
        ]
      },
